        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ricky Martin, Hank Osasuna\n- Products: Lemon La Vida Loca, \"Livin' la Vida Loca\"\n- Organizations: ITV2\n- Roles: Mad Paul\n\nFacts:\n- In 1999, \"Livin' la Vida Loca\" was released as a hit single by Puerto Rican singer Ricky Martin.\n- \"Livin' la Vida Loca\" reached number one.\n- The show Lemon La Vida Loca derived its title from Ricky Martin's 1999 hit single \"Livin' la Vida Loca\".\n- Hank Osasuna later appeared as Mad Paul in ITV2's series Lemon La Vida Loca.",
